# Your scheduled jobs. Edit this file from your laptop: it lives in the synced ~/fraim folder.
# The scheduler reloads it automatically. Times use the server timezone (TZ in .env).
# fraim's own health and update checks run separately and need no line here.
#
# Format: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
# Each job prompt lives in ~/fraim/jobs/<name>.md. Allowed tools go in <name>.tools (optional).

# Example, remove the # to enable:
# 0 8 * * 1-5 fraim-job example
